<title>UK: British Energy, S.Electric in power deal.</title>
<headline>British Energy, S.Electric in power deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nuclear power generator British Energy Plc said on Thursday it agreed to supply electricity for up to 15 years to Southern Electric Plc.  </p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The alliance, which expands the companies' existing relationship, would be non-exclusive.</p>
<p>&quot;This initiative should give a greater degree of long-term price stability by removing some of our exposure to pool price uncertainties,&quot; British Energy said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
